   "texto": [
    "**Uzun** means high / long; **kısa**, low / short. **Saç** is hair and **göz** is eye.",
    "**Uzun saçlı** = long hair; **mavi gözlü** = blue eyes. **-lı/-li/-lu/-lü** suffixes can mean «with / have»: **gözlü** (with eyes).",
